# Lot Tracker

A full-stack material lot management system built for the Full-Stack Developer Coding Assessment.

The application allows authorized users to manage material lots, track status changes, view audit history, and safely handle concurrent updates.

---

## Tech Stack

### Frontend

* React.js
* Vite
* React Router
* Axios
* Lucide React

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MySQL
* JWT
* bcryptjs
* Jest
* express-rate-limit

---

## Features

* JWT Authentication
* Viewer and Editor roles
* Lot CRUD operations
* Search and status filtering
* Server-side pagination
* Controlled status workflow
* Immutable audit trail
* Optimistic concurrency control
* 409 Conflict handling
* Database transactions
* MySQL indexes
* Write rate limiting
* 100,000+ seeded lots
* Automated tests
* Responsive React interface

