## Testing

Backend automated tests use Jest.

Run:

```bash
cd backend
npm test
```

Current result:

```text
Test Suites: 1 passed, 1 total
Tests:       10 passed, 10 total
```

Tests cover status transitions, validation, missing lots, and optimistic concurrency conflicts.

---

## API

Base URL:

```text
http://localhost:5000/api
```

Main endpoints:

```text
POST   /auth/register
POST   /auth/login

GET    /lots
GET    /lots/:id
POST   /lots
PUT    /lots/:id
PATCH  /lots/:id/status
DELETE /lots/:id

GET    /lots/:id/track
```

Protected endpoints require:

```text
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
```

